# Ignore everything in scratch/ by default, except what this project tracks.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file is intentionally IDENTICAL on trust-defense and
# fpnt-defense, and whitelists BOTH evaluation harnesses even though each
# branch only carries one of them. Whitelisting only the local harness is a
# footgun: copying or cherry-picking the other branch's harness in would leave
# it silently untracked, and the mistake surfaces only when someone else clones
# and the file is not there.
/*
!.gitignore

!nested-subdir/
!subdir/
!scratch-simulator.cc
!CMakeLists.txt

# The evaluation harnesses (one per defense branch) and the feature collector
# they share. olsr_window_features.h MUST stay byte-identical on both branches
# -- it is what makes the two defenses' datasets comparable. See docs/SCHEMA.md.
!olsr-trust-eval-mitigation.cc
!olsr-fpnt-eval-mitigation.cc
!olsr_window_features.h
